# The organisation's crew: Manny Ortega, who finds people - the hiring hall in
# the back of a bodega on Calle Ocho. (Fiction.) Reads and acts through
# Talk.State: cand_line(i), take_on(i), crew_bonus(), lawyer_for_jailed().

~ start
if not payroll
	Manny Ortega: No crew to run in this game.
	=> END
Manny Ortega: [[You need people? I got people.|Come in, sit. Coffee?|Business is good, so everybody wants to work for you.]]
if crew == 0
	Manny Ortega: Nobody on the payroll yet. Everybody starts somewhere.
else
	Manny Ortega: You've got {{crew}} on the payroll - {{money_s(wage_bill)}} every payday. They're {{crew_loyalty}} percent happy, give or take.
if unpaid > 0
	Manny Ortega: And payday came up {{money_s(unpaid)}} short. People talk when they don't get paid. To the wrong people.
=> hall

~ hall
- Hire {{cand_line(0)}} [if has_cand(0)]
	do take_on(0)
	=> hired
- Hire {{cand_line(1)}} [if has_cand(1)]
	do take_on(1)
	=> hired
- Hire {{cand_line(2)}} [if has_cand(2)]
	do take_on(2)
	=> hired
- Hire {{cand_line(3)}} [if has_cand(3)]
	do take_on(3)
	=> hired
- A bonus for everybody. ({{money_s(wage_bill)}}) [if crew > 0]
	do crew_bonus()
	Manny Ortega: [[That's how you keep people.|They'll remember that.]]
	=> hall
- Get a lawyer for {{jailed_name()}}. ($2,000) [if jailed_name() != ""]
	do lawyer_for_jailed()
	Manny Ortega: Good. Somebody with a lawyer keeps quiet. Somebody without one starts thinking.
	=> hall
- That's enough for today.
	Manny Ortega: [[You know where to find me.|Take care of your people and they take care of you.]]
	=> END

~ hired
if result != ""
	Manny Ortega: {{result}}
else
	Manny Ortega: [[Good choice. I think.|I'll send word tonight.|Starts tomorrow.]]
=> hall
